{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For What - You wake up in a strange house with no memory. Explore, find notes, and unravel the mystery. The game builds psychological tension through atmosphere and subtle storytelling, not just jump scares. <strong>In some areas, you will encounter monsters that pose a real physical threat.</strong> Decipher hidden clues to piece together a philosophical story that will make you question what is real.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> Atmospheric exploration, psychological horror, <strong>elements of survival</strong>, environmental storytelling, optional ciphers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Length:</strong> ~1+ hours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969950?t=1759478034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969950?t=1759478034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969950/ac06a16a27f363b29a4211215c1c7dcc0b67e38b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759478034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969950/ac06a16a27f363b29a4211215c1c7dcc0b67e38b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759478034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"\"The game contains scenes of violence and cruelty, including psychological tension and dark, unsettling situations. Content is intended for mature audiences and may be disturbing for sensitive players.\""},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For What - You wake up in a strange house with no memory. Explore, find notes, and unravel the mystery. The game builds psychological tension through atmosphere and subtle storytelling, not just jump scares. <strong>In some areas, you will encounter monsters that pose a real physical threat.</strong> 